---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PlainHero from '../components/PlainHero.astro';
import { PAGES } from '../data/pages';
import { SITE, telHref } from '../data/site';
import { ONLINE_BOOKING } from '../lib/booking-endpoint';

const page = PAGES.privacy;
const crumbs = [{ name: 'Privacy', path: page.path }];
const updated = 'September 2026';
---
<BaseLayout title={page.title} description={page.description} ogPhoto={page.ogPhoto} crumbs={crumbs} headerTone="solid">
  <PlainHero
    eyebrow={{ zh: '隐私', en: 'Your information' }}
    title={page.h1}
    lede={`How ${SITE.name} handles personal information. Last updated ${updated}.`}
    crumbs={crumbs}
    art="sauces"
  />

  <section class="section" aria-label="Privacy policy">
    <div class="wrap wrap--narrow prose">
      <svg class="shield" viewBox="0 0 80 90" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M40 4 72 16v24c0 22-14 38-32 46C22 78 8 62 8 40V16Z" class="shield__body" />
        <path d="M26 46l10 10 20-22" class="shield__check" />
      </svg>
      <p>
        {SITE.name} {SITE.nameZh} (“we”, “us”) is a restaurant at {SITE.address.street}, {SITE.address.city}, British
        Columbia. We follow British Columbia’s <em>Personal Information Protection Act</em> (PIPA) and collect only the
        information we need to look after our guests.
      </p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Table requests{ONLINE_BOOKING ? '' : ' (if online requests are enabled)'}:</strong> your name, phone number, and optionally your email address, the date, time and size of your party, an occasion, and any notes you add (for example allergies or a high chair).</li>
        <li><strong>Phone calls:</strong> the details you give us to reserve a table or order food.</li>
        <li><strong>Browsing this site:</strong> nothing personal. We don’t use cookies, analytics, advertising trackers or social media widgets. Our hosting provider keeps standard, short-term server logs (such as IP addresses) for security.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Why we use it</h2>
      <p>
        To confirm and manage your reservation, contact you about it, and prepare for your visit (for example, dietary
        needs). We never sell your information or use it for marketing without your consent.
      </p>

      <h2>Where it goes</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>This website is hosted on Amazon Web Services (AWS).</li>
        <li>Online table requests are processed by our booking service on AWS in Canada (ca-central-1) and delivered by email to our restaurant inbox. To stop spam, the service keeps a one-way (hashed) form of your IP address for about an hour; it can’t be used to identify you.</li>
        <li>If you choose to load the interactive map, Google receives your request under Google’s own privacy policy. It never loads unless you ask for it.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>
        We keep table-request details only as long as we need them to look after your booking, and delete them within
        30 days after your visit, unless the law requires us to keep them longer.
      </p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>
        You can ask to see, correct or delete the personal information we hold about you, or withdraw your consent,
        by calling us at <a href={telHref}>{SITE.phone.display}</a>. We’ll respond within 30 days.
      </p>

      <h2>Safeguards</h2>
      <p>
        This site is served only over encrypted HTTPS connections with strict security headers, and table requests are
        checked and sent over encrypted connections. Access to requests is limited to the staff who manage reservations.
      </p>

      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>
        Our owner is responsible for privacy at {SITE.name}. Please call us at <a href={telHref}>{SITE.phone.display}</a> and
        ask for the owner. If you’re not satisfied with our response, you can
        contact the Office of the Information and Privacy Commissioner for British Columbia.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .shield {
    width: 72px;
    height: 81px;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .shield__body {
    fill: var(--seaglass);
    stroke: var(--jade);
    stroke-width: 3;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  .shield__check {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--jade);
    stroke-width: 5;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }
</style>
